1. Modified | Method implementation
   Changed the implementation of `cla` from directly setting `self._position = None` and calling `self.axis.cla()` when `self.axis is not None` to calling `self.clear()`.
   The original implementation included:
   * Assignment statement: set `self._position` to `None`;
   * Conditional statement: test `self.axis is not None` and call `self.axis.cla()`.

   The new implementation includes:
   * Method call: `self.clear()`.
